title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0 and not started
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 10;
card-image: img/vorwarts_2.jpg
go-to: rm_main

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: kanalarbeiter_advisor, classical_advisor, paleorev_advisor, neorev_advisor, sofo_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
on-arrival: {!
Q.last_time_check = Q.time;
if (Q.time > Q.last_time_check) {
    Q.advisor_1 = [];

    for (let key in Q) {
        if (key.endsWith('_advisor') && Q[key] === 1) {
            Q.advisor_1.push(key.replace('_advisor', ''));
        }
    }
}
console.log(Q.advisor_1)
!}
frequency: 1
go-to: rm_main_menu

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is a diverse and <span class="tooltip-text" title="good mod">dynamic</span> party, but its internal divisions cause factional dissent to gradually build if a faction feels neglected in leadership positions.

Appointing individual advisors will boost their respective faction's loyalty and influence, at the cost of increasing resentment among the sidelined factions. 

<span class="tooltip-wrap">Classical<span class="tooltip-tip"><strong>Klassische Marxisten</strong><br><i>Classical Marxists</i><strong></strong><br><br> <img src="img/achievement/eiserne_front.png" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; vertical-align: middle;"> They view Marxism as key to the working class's emancipation. These are the radicals and revolutionaries of the party. <br> Strengths: Idealistic, anti-militarism<br> Weaknesses: Inflexible, confrontational</span></span>

<span class="tooltip-wrap">Kanalarbeiter<span class="tooltip-tip"><strong>Kanalarbeiter</strong><br><i>'Sewer Workers'</i><strong></strong><br><br> <img src="img/achievement/eiserne_front.png" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; vertical-align: middle;"> They are party organizers focused on the day-to-day activities of political organizing rather than abstract theory. They provide stability and unity within the party. <br>Strengths: Pragmatic, unifying<br> Weaknesses: Conservative, resistant to change</span></span>

<span class="tooltip-wrap">Neorevisionist<span class="tooltip-tip"><strong>Neorevisionisten</strong><br><i>Neorevisionists</i><strong></strong><br><br> <img src="img/ideologies/neorevisionismus.png" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; vertical-align: middle;"> They are the labor leaders and union organizers who believe in working within the system to improve workers' conditions. <br>Strengths: Connected to the labor base, pragmatic<br> Weaknesses: Bureaucratic, sometimes opportunistic</span></span>

<span class="tooltip-wrap">Paleorevisionist<span class="tooltip-tip"><strong>Paläorevisionisten</strong><br><i>Paleorevisionists</i><strong></strong><br><br> <img src="img/achievement/eiserne_front.png" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; vertical-align: middle;"> They are the government officials and career politicians who balance revolution and reform. They bridge the gap between the party establishment and more radical wings. <br> Strengths: Experienced, diplomatic<br> Weaknesses: Compromising, sometimes detached from the base</span></span>

[? if social_progressivism: <span class="tooltip-wrap">Social Progressive<span class="tooltip-tip"><strong>Sozialfortschrittlicher / Sofos</strong><br><i>Social Progressives / Sofos</i><strong></strong><br><br>A minority wing that advocates for cultural and social liberalism alongside economic socialism. <br>Strengths: Progressive on culture, modern<br>Weaknesses: Alienated from more traditional base, sometimes cosmopolitan</span></span> ?]

@rm_main_menu

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_2 = [];

for (let key in Q) {
    if (key.endsWith('_advisor') && Q[key] === 1) {
        Q.advisor_2.push(key.replace('_advisor', ''));
    }
}

console.log(Q.advisor_2)

function arraysAreEqual(arr1, arr2) {
    if (arr1.length !== arr2.length) return false;
    for (let i = 0; i < arr1.length; i++) {
        if (arr1[i] !== arr2[i]) return false;
    }
    return true;
}

if (arraysAreEqual(Q.advisor_1, Q.advisor_2)) {
    Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
}
!}
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


@remove_hilferding
title: Remove Hilferding
view-if: hilferding_advisor = 1
on-arrival: hilferding_advisor = 0; kanalarbeiter_dissent += 10; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main_menu

Hilferding has been removed as an advisor. The Centrist faction disapproves.

